\newlabel{tab:power}{{2}{7}{Exact operating characteristics of the Kupiec POF test and the exact binomial test at $\alpha = 0.05$. ``Size'' is the rejection rate when $p_{\text {true}} = \alpha $; ``Power'' is the rejection rate at the indicated true breach rate}{table.caption.6}{}}
